OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786054681
OL,3,CItalian waste workers help lottery
OL,4,Cwinner find discarded E1 million ticket
OL,6,FAn Italian lottery player who
OL,7,Faccidentally threw away a winning
OL,8,Fticket worth one million euros has had
OL,9,Ftheir day made by a refuse company who
OL,10,Fspent two days digging through rubbish
OL,11,Fto find the missing slip.
OL,13,FThe anonymous player threw away the
OL,14,Fticket in the southern Italian town of
OL,15,FBitonto after seeing it was "non-
OL,16,Fpayable" - which they thought meant
OL,17,Ftheir numbers had not come up.
OL,19,FThe term actually meant the shop where
OL,20,Fthe ticket was purchased could not pay
OL,21,Fout such a large prize.
OL,26,@lD@WOk
