FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786054681
OL,3,CItalian waste workers help lottery
OL,4,Cwinner find discarded E1 million ticket
OL,6,FThe winner only realised their mistake
OL,7,Fwhen a family member pointed out their
OL,8,Fchosen numbers of, 2, 4, 8, 19 and 51
OL,9,Fhad been drawn.
OL,11,FThey then immediately contacted the
OL,12,Fshop, only to find the waste had
OL,13,Falready been collected.
OL,15,FThey then contacted the local refuse
OL,16,Fcompany SANB to see if they could
OL,17,Fhelp, and the company agreed to look
OL,18,Ffor the missing ticket.
OL,26,@lD@WOk
