FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786054681
OL,3,CItalian waste workers help lottery
OL,4,Cwinner find discarded E1 million ticket
OL,6,FDirector Nicola Roberto Toscano said
OL,7,Fon Facebook that as soon as they were
OL,8,Fcontacted, they agreed to stop the
OL,9,Florry carrying the rubbish and to try
OL,10,Fand find the ticket.
OL,12,FWorkers spent two days at a special
OL,13,Ffacility digging through the rubbish
OL,14,Fand found numerous damaged and
OL,15,Funrecoverable tickets before they
OL,16,Feventually found the winning slip.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@lD@WOk
