FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786054681
OL,3,CItalian waste workers help lottery
OL,4,Cwinner find discarded E1 million ticket
OL,6,FToscano said: "It is often said that
OL,7,Fwaste can be a resource. Here... there
OL,8,Fare those who have decided to take
OL,9,Fthis expression really too literally."
OL,11,FToscano told local Italian media it
OL,12,Fwas lucky the incident happened on a
OL,13,FSunday otherwise it would have been
OL,14,Ftaken straight to landfill.
OL,16,FHe also said the winner had promised
OL,17,Fto cover the costs of the recovery.
OL,26,@lD@WOk
