OL,3,CItalian waste workers help lottery
OL,4,Cwinner find discarded E1 million ticket
OL,6,FAfter the team had handed over the
OL,7,Fwinning ticket to its owner, Toscano
OL,8,Fsaid they went and bought a scratch
OL,9,Fcard and won fifty euros.
OL,26,@lD@WOk
